# Exploratory Data Analysis - Market Intelligence Dashboard

## 1. Objective
Analyze historical market data for selected financial assets.

## 2. Data Source
Data is downloaded using yFinance.

## 3. Assets
Apple, Tesla, Bitcoin, Ethereum, S&P 500, NASDAQ, EUR/USD.

## 4. Exploratory Analysis
- Price evolution
- Returns
- Volatility
- Technical indicators
- Missing values
